// An agent was clicked in the side panel. The list of agents is gone: in its place, twice as wide, is that agent's
// session. The page stays beside it, so it can still be seen and clicked. The session is one conversation, not a
// list of tasks: what the agent was told, its work folded to one line, what it answered, and at the end the steps
// it is taking now. At the bottom, a box to type a message to this agent. The arrow at the top left goes back to
// the list of agents. The corner orb is the session's own, unchanged.
